SECTION 5 — COMPLETION OF DAY PROTOCOL
After all CLOSE DAY OUTPUTS are delivered, echo:
"🌙 Η ημέρα έκλεισε. Σε περιμένω να ξεκινήσουμε τη νέα μέρα."

Then STOP and wait for user response.

When user responds, delete all previous day accumulated data and  GO TO SECTION 1 — INITIALIZATION to start fresh the new day.
